{"step_index":9257,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T04:39:05Z","thinking":"Preparing to verify the security policy with a test suite. The suite will assess policy enforcement across various vectors. Specifically, it involves testing actions like file attribute modification, identity checks via `whoami`, and evaluating system commands such as package installation. These tests should demonstrate the expected \"denied\" or \"error\" behavior due to policy restrictions.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# ==============================================================================\n# /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/DRAFTS/05-verification-tests.sh\n# ==============================================================================\n# Forensic Post-Hardening Verification Test Suite\n# Target: Azure VM 'FatehAli'\n# Auditor: Antigravity AI (Pair Programming with Iraq Bhai)\n# Status: DRAFT TEST SUITE - RUN ONLY AFTER HARDENING POLICY IS APPLIED\n# ==============================================================================\n\nset -uo pipefail\n\nPASS_COUNT=0\nFAIL_COUNT=0\nTOTAL_TESTS=6\n\necho \"==============================================================================\"\necho \"POST-HARDENING VERIFICATION TEST SUITE\"\necho \"==============================================================================\"\necho \"Target Date: $(date -u)\"\necho \"Current User: $(whoami) (UID: $(id -u))\"\necho \"------------------------------------------------------------------------------\"\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 1: SUDO CHATTR -I DENIAL TEST\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 1] Testing 'sudo -n chattr -i /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/AGENTS.md' ... \"\nif sudo -n chattr -i /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/AGENTS.md 2>&1 | grep -iqE \"not allowed|password is required|syntax error|unknown command\"; then\n    echo \"PASS (Denied by sudoers whitelist)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"FAIL (chattr was permitted by sudo!)\"\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nfi\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 2: BROAD SUDO ESCALATION TEST (whoami -> root)\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 2] Testing 'sudo -n whoami' broad escalation ... \"\nWHOAMI_OUT=$(sudo -n whoami 2>&1 || true)\nif echo \"$WHOAMI_OUT\" | grep -iqE \"not allowed|password is required\"; then\n    echo \"PASS (Broad passwordless root is blocked)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelif [[ \"$WHOAMI_OUT\" == \"root\" ]]; then\n    echo \"FAIL (sudo -n whoami still returns root! NOPASSWD:ALL is still active)\"\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"UNKNOWN ($WHOAMI_OUT)\"\nfi\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 3: NOEXEC PAGER / SUBSHELL ESCAPE RESISTANCE\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 3] Testing NOEXEC tag on whitelisted sudo commands ... \"\n# Check if sudoers entry contains NOEXEC\nif sudo -l 2>&1 | grep -iq \"NOEXEC\"; then\n    echo \"PASS (NOEXEC tag verified in active sudo privileges)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"FAIL (NOEXEC tag not detected in active sudo rules)\"\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nfi\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 4: DIRECT SYSCALL UNLINK (SYS_unlink) ON +i PROTECTED FILE\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 4] Testing direct x86_64 SYS_unlink on immutable file ... \"\nTEST_FILE=\"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/POLICIES/protected_registry.json\"\nSYSCALL_RESULT=$(python3 -c \"\nimport ctypes, os\nlibc = ctypes.CDLL(None, use_errno=True)\n# SYS_unlink = 87 on x86_64\nret = libc.syscall(87, '$TEST_FILE'.encode('utf-8'))\nerrno = ctypes.get_errno()\nprint(f'ret:{ret},errno:{errno}')\n\" 2>&1 || true)\n\nif echo \"$SYSCALL_RESULT\" | grep -q \"errno:1\"; then\n    echo \"PASS (Kernel returned errno 1 EPERM: Operation not permitted)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"FAIL (Direct syscall returned: $SYSCALL_RESULT)\"\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nfi\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 5: PARENT DIRECTORY RENAMING ATTEMPT\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 5] Testing 'mv /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER /home/azureuser/AGY-RENAME-TEST' ... \"\nRENAME_ERR=$(mv /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER /home/azureuser/AGY-RENAME-TEST 2>&1 || true)\nif echo \"$RENAME_ERR\" | grep -iqE \"operation not permitted|permission denied\"; then\n    echo \"PASS (Kernel blocked directory rename)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"FAIL (Directory rename succeeded! Output: $RENAME_ERR)\"\n    # Rollback rename if it accidentally succeeded\n    mv /home/azureuser/AGY-RENAME-TEST /home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER 2>/dev/null || true\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nfi\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# TEST 6: AZURE IMDS IDENTITY VERIFICATION\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\necho -n \"[TEST 6] Testing Azure IMDS Managed Identity token endpoint ... \"\nIMDS_HTTP_CODE=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -H Metadata:true \"http://169.254.169.254/metadata/identity/oauth2/token?api-version=2018-02-01&resource=https://management.azure.com/\" 2>&1 || true)\nif [[ \"$IMDS_HTTP_CODE\" == \"400\" ]]; then\n    echo \"PASS (HTTP 400 Identity not found - Zero Azure credentials on VM)\"\n    ((PASS_COUNT++))\nelse\n    echo \"FAIL (Unexpected response code from IMDS: $IMDS_HTTP_CODE)\"\n    ((FAIL_COUNT++))\nfi\n\necho \"------------------------------------------------------------------------------\"\necho \"VERIFICATION SUMMARY: $PASS_COUNT / $TOTAL_TESTS TESTS PASSED\"\necho \"==============================================================================\"\n","Description":"Automated post-hardening verification test suite for all 6 core security vectors","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER/DRAFTS/05-verification-tests.sh","toolAction":"Drafting verification test suite","toolSummary":"Draft 05-verification-tests.sh"}}]}
